-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e9b47499-c09a-41e7-940d-1c73010cb537\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b38e6083-92f5-42d0-b888-a69131620712\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ef7551b8-fc91-4c62-a651-086d91320827\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ccb1b2ea-d415-4143-9a57-8e73237f1a36\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f4d5e760-4205-4ac7-bb1f-3dba3936ddf5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1e43d8b3-624d-4e81-95e0-9e5af043784a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ad69654c-0088-4f57-a35d-a771737c13dd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-887b27cb-3745-4493-809b-8e5f74464414\">​​자세한 내용은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-95988c7d-7d48-4873-b8c3-8894ed8ee0cd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a87951fb-38ce-4018-8e58-19e5bb6363f8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b6e0ebac-f501-45da-9bb4-2c349b713609\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e0881fe7-c79d-47c4-b7a7-fddc0d9ed241\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5153341-3c7a-4020-969f-c5c68647b164\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c404d7b1-81f1-44dc-ab20-6c1423e1da8d\"><b>📢 8/26(화) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1bcdb347-f81e-4a29-a470-27c677bdbe69\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a6e1e64f-47ee-4f7b-adec-7ebe37f4e736\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2fe5064f-63c0-42d0-a7ad-f512f352a5a0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-63db8f47-5379-4f92-86b8-1529197f891b\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5c7df79b-92ee-462b-b3f1-249f78a1bb07\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-289a5733-15e5-4201-94fa-b3524ef2f2ce\">- 8/26(화) 17:00 ~ 19:00 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c7eb22f9-aef0-458e-80b4-6e200e56cd64\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-34872324-f810-4429-b459-11c05c4a3429\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-80dd13fb-455d-45b1-9a54-8f302f8ed416\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-89ac552b-491b-4211-8748-bf88c12c7f67\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-357a9ef2-a4db-4036-846c-32324f7b9d21\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bcdf5574-ade6-415d-82c7-77e52a11b2eb\">1. 특정 상황에서 지즈와 전투 중 게임이 비정상적으로 종료되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f16ef2c0-ffcf-4424-857f-98958b08dff1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fbde541a-0751-47e5-ba5b-225fea8ae409\">2. 특정 상황에서 지즈의 스킬 「꼼짝마 광선」 발동 시, 제압 상태가 정상적으로 적용되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-461bf584-fba7-41d2-8df2-70b475b8ced8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-25752b95-8634-429d-8ba1-02b2aaac7288\">3. 특정 상황에서 지즈의 전투 패턴이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce87e6b6-aeab-448d-bdbd-6b92df25aeb2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-360601c9-afa1-49b2-aea5-554020477e61\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ee9ed73-3b48-4f7b-b6a9-da6ab42f78c3\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4c0406c0-52a2-4f0b-a5f7-75127fc6880d\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa84f3ce-b279-40ce-868f-c22f16e4ad15\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ccfa1da5-f8d0-4010-aaf7-75faf25560c9\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a46f6b45-fa4f-431e-9a4c-d650e07bf2aa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3348ca72-8468-412c-887e-2408e7bdd63d\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-05f3cf85-3728-4b06-95bf-a993acd13164\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eba5a2b5-1e48-4084-a941-6724253a0c23\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9f1e0e0b-8529-4519-8c4f-c015d91f58e4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8e6f9f57-9827-4a47-ae54-739c21122062\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-9dc6845f-6f6f-413f-96be-645a098aeb55\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c06c1981-5e19-40a2-9630-3f96c95ac4ca\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-c06c1981-5e19-40a2-9630-3f96c95ac4ca\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA4MjZfMTM3/MDAxNzU2MTk5Mjg1ODkx.Uxdca-3THhLQRUMeSUCI6D5M1jyDRNDUDLVT04nSOOcg.lg_U-dqPWpU-cEojW5ZnPUytdRWWRSjOPJPjVcKDuCAg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA4MjZfMTM3/MDAxNzU2MTk5Mjg1ODkx.Uxdca-3THhLQRUMeSUCI6